Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 21:54:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 07949/11362] [outer-loop] Adversarial-review repairs to the
 convention-perturbation battery: the HUD lever's verdict is WITHDRAWN as
 uninterpretable

All six review findings reproduced against the raw cells; none was wrong.

FATAL: the pass-region witness was computed at C0 and then attached to gates
SCORED at C1/C2, so the HUD lever's headline gate certified its pass region with
cells from a different condition. At C2 the lever's only two support games are
won by NO arm on any seed -- zero discriminating games, undefined sign test --
so its FAIL verdict was arithmetically forced, not measured. The witness is now
per-condition, a fourth precondition (anchor_support_still_live) fails, and the
lever reports NOT_DECIDABLE_BY_THIS_DESIGN.

The review's suggested repair (a milder geometric condition) was BUILT and
MEASURED, and answers negatively: with EDGE_BAR_EDGE_TOLERANCE=2 and r11l's mask
a single row at index 0, a k=1 roll leaves the convention intact (detector still
fires, HUD-alone still wins 5/5); the first violating magnitude, k=2, is one at
which r11l is won by no arm. tn36 dies at k=1. Inside the roll family
convention-breakage and task-destruction are inseparable. What would decide it
(a row-strip swap) is specified in ops/known-issues.md.

Also fixed: retention 0.75 no longer reported as a measured degradation (paired
deltas [-1,-1,-1,-2,+1], sign test p=0.19 -- survival stands, degradation not
resolved at n=5); the shipped-config frontier contrast is surfaced alongside the
flip-time one (retention 0.333, one seed at zero, loses r11l+tn36 every seed);
exact sign tests now run on the GAME unit for every contrast, with
n_independent_replicates and UNDERPOWERED_SINGLE_GAME_SUPPORT; deterministic
arm-pairs report n_seed_replicates_effective=1 rather than 5; a per-condition
dose CEILING stamps DOSE_SATURATED and reports the gained-set Jaccard vs C0
(0.2 at C2 -- a similarly-sized gain on different games).

New measurements: the tn36 efficiency reclassification re-ran on 5 seeds and
HOLDS (wins at budget 8000 5/5, cost 3.54-3.88x vs the single-cell "~3.5x"); the
r11l capability loss re-ran on 5 seeds at budgets 8000 and 16000 and HOLDS.

Incidental: a pre-existing mypy LSP error in experiment_5852 (committed in
d9325d5bd) blocked the pre-commit hook. Suppressed narrowly at the site with the
reason recorded, rather than bypassing the hook.

NO flag flipped; measurement only. adversarial_verify: 0 flagged.
summarize_artifact: live re-check clean, exit 0.

